                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "%lld geöffnete Laufwerke werden ausgeworfen"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "variations": {
            "plural": {
              "one": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Ejecting the open drive"
                }
              },
              "other": {
                "stringUnit": {
                  "state": "translated",
                  "value": "Ejecting %lld open drives"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ejecting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wird ausgeworfen …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Engine output": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ausgabe der Engine"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the drive's passphrase.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib die Passphrase des Laufwerks ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the drive's password, or its 48-digit recovery key.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib das Passwort des Laufwerks ein oder seinen 48-stelligen Wiederherstellungsschlüssel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything else was removed. %@ itself could not be moved to the Bin — %@ — so drag it there yourself to finish.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alles Übrige wurde entfernt. %@ selbst konnte nicht in den Papierkorb bewegt werden — %@ — bewege es zum Abschluss selbst dorthin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expanded": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eingeblendet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "External": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Extern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Forget": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vergessen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full Disk Access": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Festplattenvollzugriff"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Full Disk Access — macOS will not let any app read a drive’s raw contents without it. It cannot be requested, so it has to be switched on by hand": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Festplattenvollzugriff — ohne ihn lässt macOS keine App den Rohinhalt eines Laufwerks lesen. Er kann nicht angefordert werden und muss daher von Hand aktiviert werden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "GNU General Public License": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "GNU General Public License"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Granted": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erteilt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ausblenden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide the credential": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eingabe verbergen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hide the details": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Details ausblenden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How %@ works, and what it supports": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wie %@ funktioniert und was es unterstützt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How it works": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Funktionsweise"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Internal": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is in the Bin. Nothing else of it is left on this Mac.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es liegt im Papierkorb. Sonst ist nichts davon auf diesem Mac verblieben."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LUKS drives from Linux, both LUKS1 and LUKS2": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LUKS-Laufwerke von Linux, LUKS1 und LUKS2"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LUKS volumes whose header is stored separately from the drive": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LUKS-Volumes, deren Header getrennt vom Laufwerk gespeichert ist"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "LVM inside LUKS, as Ubuntu, Debian, Mint and Fedora set it up. Several volumes on one drive all unlock together": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "LVM innerhalb von LUKS, wie es Ubuntu, Debian, Mint und Fedora einrichten. Mehrere Volumes auf einem Laufwerk werden gemeinsam entsperrt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Language": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sprache"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last checked: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zuletzt gesucht: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave Open": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geöffnet lassen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets %@ read the encrypted data itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ermöglicht %@, die verschlüsselten Daten selbst zu lesen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets %@ read the encrypted data itself. macOS blocks this without it, even for administrators, and it cannot be requested — it has to be switched on by hand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ermöglicht %@, die verschlüsselten Daten selbst zu lesen. Ohne diese Berechtigung blockiert macOS das selbst für Administratoren, und sie kann nicht angefordert werden — sie muss von Hand aktiviert werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Licence": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lizenz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Light": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hell"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ort"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Locked": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gesperrt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looking for encrypted drives…": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suche nach verschlüsselten Laufwerken …"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lúkotta is Finnish for “without a lock”, from lukko, a lock, with the ending -tta marking the absence of something. The stress falls on the first syllable, as it always does in Finnish.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lúkotta ist Finnisch für „ohne Schloss“, von lukko, einem Schloss, mit der Endung -tta, die das Fehlen von etwas bezeichnet. Die Betonung liegt auf der ersten Silbe, wie im Finnischen immer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Menu Bar": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menüleiste"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Moving %@ to the Bin": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ wird in den Papierkorb bewegt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Needed": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erforderlich"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No encrypted drives found": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keine verschlüsselten Laufwerke gefunden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No reason was reported. The details below may say more.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wurde kein Grund gemeldet. Die Details unten sagen möglicherweise mehr."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Not found in this build.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In dieser Version nicht enthalten."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing is installed. The engine ships inside the app, nothing leaves your Mac, and a drive is only written to when you write to it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wird nichts installiert. Die Engine steckt in der App, nichts verlässt deinen Mac, und auf ein Laufwerk wird nur geschrieben, wenn du darauf schreibst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once the background helper is set up, updating will leave unlocked drives alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sobald der Hintergrund-Helfer eingerichtet ist, lässt ein Update entsperrte Laufwerke unberührt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
